---
import DownloadButtons from '../../components/DownloadButtons.astro'
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="Flash-Sale Banner Maker for Shopee &amp; TikTok Shop: AI-generated, editable | Oia"
  description="Generate flash-sale banners for Shopee, Lazada and TikTok Shop with real AI typography. Change the price with one prompt, the style stays. Free, open source, bring your own provider."
  ogTitle="Flash-Sale Banner Maker for Shopee &amp; TikTok Shop | Oia"
  ogDescription="AI banners with real typography. Change the price with one prompt, the style stays."
  canonical="https://oia.solutions/use-cases/flash-sale-banners/"
  base="../../"
>
<header class="pageHero">
  <p class="kicker">Use case, e-commerce</p>
  <h1>Flash-sale banners that look designed, and change in one prompt.</h1>
  <p class="lede">One sentence in. The copy renders into the artwork. When the price moves, a repaint keeps the style.</p>
  <DownloadButtons rowClass="ctaRow" anchorId="download" installHref="../../install/" ghost={{ href: '../../prompts/', label: 'Copy the prompts' }} />
</header>

<main class="pageMain">
  <div class="frame">
    <img loading="lazy" src="../../assets/mori-comparison.webp" alt="MORI campaign before and after a reference-image edit: 20% OFF becomes 30% OFF, retaining the visual style" width="1600" height="860">
    <span class="frameCaption mono">real generations · same banner, one repaint</span>
  </div>

  <div class="ucGrid">
    <div>
      <h2 class="catH" style="margin-top:8px">From idea to live banner</h2>
      <div class="stepsList">
        <div><span class="n">01: DESCRIBE</span><h3>One sentence, right size</h3><p>“Milk-tea flash sale, 20% off today” + Shopee 1:1.</p></div>
        <div><span class="n">02: GENERATE</span><h3>Typography baked in</h3><p>≈ 1 image, on your plan.</p></div>
        <div><span class="n">03: REPRICE</span><h3>Ask, preview, apply</h3><p>Select the banner, type the new number.</p></div>
        <div><span class="n">04: EXPORT</span><h3>Marketplace-ready</h3><p>PNG · JPG · PDF · PPTX.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="catH" style="margin-top:8px">Built for marketplaces</h2>
      <div class="factRow" role="group" aria-label="Marketplace facts">
        <span>Shopee 1024 · Lazada 800 · TikTok Shop 1080</span>
        <span>brand kit rides along</span>
        <span>attach your product photo</span>
        <span>≈ 1 image, shown first</span>
      </div>
      <div class="faq" style="margin-top:26px">
        <details><summary>How do I change the price on an AI banner?</summary><p>Select the banner layer and ask: <em>change '20% OFF TODAY' to '30% OFF TODAY', keep everything else the same</em>. Oia regenerates with the new number in the same style, previews it, and replaces the layer only when you apply.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What sizes are supported?</summary><p>Shopee 1:1 (1024), Lazada 1:1 (800), TikTok Shop 1:1 (1080), plus posters, 9:16 story sizes, presentations and A4.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Does it cost anything?</summary><p>The app is free and open source (MIT). Generations use your own provider, a ChatGPT plan via the bundled Codex CLI, or your OpenAI/fal API key. Every action shows its cost before you run it.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
</Page>
